Package: relay
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Felag Engineering <michael.rapp@gleipnir.dev>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Homepage: https://github.com/Felag-Engineering/relay
Description: Relay, the fleet-administration control plane.
 The package installs the Relay, its Unix account and its hardened unit.
 It never starts the Relay and never runs the first-boot command.
